### 🆕 Create a new job
POST http://localhost:5000/api/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "serialNumber": "ST-123456",
  "model": "TOOL-ABC",
  "workcellId": 1,
  "vendorId": 1,
  "areaId": 1,
  "startTime": "2025-11-20T08:00:00.000Z",
  "endTime": "2025-11-20T10:00:00.000Z"
}

###

### 🆕 Create a job without optional fields
POST http://localhost:5000/api/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "serialNumber": "ST-999999",
  "workcellId": 2
}

###

### 📄 Get all jobs
GET http://localhost:5000/api/jobs
Accept: application/json

###

### 📄 Get jobs filtered by areaId
GET http://localhost:5000/api/jobs?areaId=1
Accept: application/json

###

### 📄 Get jobs filtered by workcellId
GET http://localhost:5000/api/jobs?workcellId=1
Accept: application/json

###

### 📄 Get jobs filtered by vendorId
GET http://localhost:5000/api/jobs?vendorId=1
Accept: application/json

###

### 📄 Get jobs filtered by status
GET http://localhost:5000/api/jobs?status=Booked
Accept: application/json

###

### 📅 Get jobs created within a date range
GET http://localhost:5000/api/jobs?from=2025-11-20T00:00:00.000Z&to=2025-11-22T00:00:00.000Z
Accept: application/json

###

### 🔍 Get single job by id
GET http://localhost:5000/api/jobs/1
Accept: application/json

###

### ✏️ Update job status
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/jobs/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Crating"
}

###

### 🔍 Invalid id test
GET http://localhost:5000/api/jobs/abc
Accept: application/json
